  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*has a dead transition 'p_wr_state_frm_ctrl_upd => p_wr_state_wait_csum'"              -comment "Created by ewanm    - Only relevant in 128b datapaths." 
  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*has a dead transition 'SFSM_STATUS1 => SFSM_DATA'"                                      -comment "Created by ewanm    - This is an XGM specific state transition. Cannot happen with GEM." 
  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*has a dead transition 'IDLE_N_CHECK_FOR_EXPRESS0 => E_RECEIVE_DATA_NBUFF'"              -comment "Created by fmalaspi - This is likely a tool bug. There's no dead transition, the Code Coverage has shown that all the transitions are hit and all the states of all the FSMs as well. Waived"
  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*has a dead transition 'E_RECEIVE_DATA_NBUFF => E_RECEIVE_DATA_NBUFF'"                   -comment "Created by fmalaspi - This is likely a tool bug. There's no dead transition, the Code Coverage has shown that all the transitions are hit and all the states of all the FSMs as well. Waived"
  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*has a dead transition 'E_RECEIVE_DATA_NBUFF => IDLE_N_CHECK_FOR_EXPRESS0'"              -comment "Created by fmalaspi - This is likely a tool bug. There's no dead transition, the Code Coverage has shown that all the transitions are hit and all the states of all the FSMs as well. Waived"
  waive -rule "Av_fsm02" -msg "*fc.state' has a dead transition '* => IDLE'"                                             -comment "Created by fmalaspi - Tool has missed the transition because it is outside of the official state machine. Could be recoded but is 0 risk and waived for this release"

