  waive -rule "Combo_Paths02" -comment "Created by ewanm - our synthesis trials focus on max timing. We do however have false paths added between clock domains for min.  Waived"
  waive -rule "Clk_Gen05" -msg "Clocks *have distinct roots*but are in the same clock_group and there is at least one communicating path between these clocks" -comment "Created by ewanm - Yes this is true. This is a symptom of being IP level constraints and the clocks are inputs to the core. In reality, the synchronous clocks will come from one root at SoC level."

